{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Baby Go — Provider Store",
    "description": "Store del provider (1:1). **No enviar storeId**: se resuelve del JWT.\n\n**Base:** /api/v1/store  |  **Auth:** Bearer {{token}}\n\nFlujo: POST /profile → cell → avatar → delivery → delivery-pricing → customer-pickup → bank-account → confirmation → Connect.\n\n`meta.state`: missing-info | pending-review | active\nAvatar: form-data `avatar` (File) → Cloudinary HTTPS.\nDelivery pricing en **centavos**. `days` = índices a `timeRanges`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Store",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Obtener mi store",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bearer provider. Store 1:1 del token. 404 `store_not_found` si todavía no creó perfil.\nRespuesta: id, name, avatar, country, address, cellPhone, delivery, customerPickup, stripeConnect, bankAccount (sin IBAN completo), meta."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1b. Obtener perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Alias de GET /store. Mismo payload."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Crear perfil (store)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Baby Confy\",\n  \"country\": \"NL\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"addressLine1\": \"Seevank 144, 1161 AR Zwanenburg, Netherlands\",\n    \"addressLine2\": \"alguna indicacion extra\",\n    \"placeId\": \"ChIJxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n  },\n  \"cellPhone\": \"+315615628854\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. Una sola store por provider → `store_already_exists`.\nBody: `{ name, country (ISO-2), address: { addressLine1, addressLine2?, placeId }, cellPhone }`.\nDispara OTP al celular. En local puede devolver `devCode`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Actualizar perfil (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Baby Confy Updated\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"addressLine2\": \"nueva indicacion extra\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Parcial: `name`, `country`, `address` (merge), `cellPhone`. Si cambia el celular, `meta.cellValidated` vuelve a false. Body vacío → `no_fields_to_update`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Reenviar código (WhatsApp)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/cell-verification/resend",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "cell-verification",
                "resend"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reenvía OTP (WhatsApp o SMS según env). En local puede incluir `devCode`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Validar código celular",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/cell-verification",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "cell-verification"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Body `{ code }`. Errores: `invalid_code`, `code_expired`. Marca `meta.cellValidated`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Subir avatar",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "avatar",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/avatar",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "avatar"
              ]
            },
            "description": "multipart field **`avatar`** tipo File (PNG/JPEG/WEBP/GIF, máx 5MB). NO setear Content-Type a mano.\nSe sube a Cloudinary; `store.avatar` queda HTTPS."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6a. Delivery — horario por días",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": true,\n  \"timeRanges\": [\n    \"7:30-9:30\",\n    \"12:30-14:00\",\n    \"17:30-19:00\",\n    \"10:00-15:00\"\n  ],\n  \"days\": {\n    \"mon\": [0, 1, 2],\n    \"tue\": [0, 1],\n    \"sat\": [3]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/delivery",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "delivery"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`{ available, timeRanges: [\"7:30-9:30\", ...], days: { mon: [0,1], ... } }`.\n`days.*` son índices de `timeRanges` (máx 3 por día)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6b. Delivery — 24/7",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": true,\n  \"available24h\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/delivery",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "delivery"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`{ available: true, available24h: true }`. No hace falta timeRanges/days."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6c. Delivery pricing",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"basePrice\": 100,\n  \"priceKm\": 30,\n  \"maxDeliveryDistance\": 30\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/delivery-pricing",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "delivery-pricing"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`{ basePrice, priceKm, maxDeliveryDistance }` en **centavos** y km. Requiere haber configurado delivery. `meta.lastSteep` = delivery-pricing."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7a. Customer pickup — horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": true,\n  \"timeRanges\": [\n    \"7:30-9:30\",\n    \"12:30-14:00\",\n    \"17:30-19:00\",\n    \"10:00-15:00\"\n  ],\n  \"days\": {\n    \"mon\": [0, 1],\n    \"thu\": [2],\n    \"sat\": [3]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/customer-pickup",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "customer-pickup"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Igual shape que delivery, máx 2 intervalos por día."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7a. Customer pickup — 24/7",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"available\": true,\n  \"available24h\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/customer-pickup",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "customer-pickup"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`{ available: true, available24h: true }`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7a. Datos bancarios (payout)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountType\": \"IBAN\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Jhon\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n  \"country\": \"NL\",\n  \"currency\": \"eur\",\n  \"iban\": \"NL91ABNA0417164300\",\n  \"bankName\": \"ABN AMRO\",\n  \"swiftCode\": \"ABNANL2A\",\n  \"address\": \"Seevank 144, Zwanenburg\",\n  \"entityType\": \"individual\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/bank-account",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "bank-account"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`accountType`: `IBAN` (+ `iban`) o `NUMBER` (+ `accountNumber`).\nTambién: firstName, lastName, country (ISO-2), currency?, bankName, swiftCode?, routingNumber?, address?, entityType: individual|company.\nNo se persiste el IBAN completo: last4 + token Stripe."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7ab. Confirmación final",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"acceptedTerms\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/confirmation",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "confirmation"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`{ acceptedTerms: true }`. Requiere cell validado + bank. Pasa `meta.state` a `pending-review`.\nErrores: `terms_not_accepted`, `cell_not_validated`, `bank_account_required`, `store_already_confirmed`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7b. Stripe Connect — account link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"returnUrl\": \"http://localhost:3000/api/stripe-connect/return\",\n  \"refreshUrl\": \"http://localhost:3000/api/stripe-connect/refresh\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/stripe-connect/account-link",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "stripe-connect",
                "account-link"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Opcional `{ returnUrl, refreshUrl }`. Devuelve URL de onboarding Stripe Express."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7c. Stripe Connect — sync status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/stripe-connect/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "stripe-connect",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sincroniza chargesEnabled/payoutsEnabled desde Stripe y devuelve la store."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7d. Movimientos de pagos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store/movements",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store",
                "movements"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "transferred",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Query opcional `status`. Pagos de la store del token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Eliminar store",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/store",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "store"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Borra la store del provider (y avatar en Cloudinary). No manda storeId."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
